gatT(){return"The price you see before booking is the price you pay for that trip, unless you change the route or destination during the ride, add waiting time or stops, or a fee shown before booking applies. You pay with the payment method chosen in the app. Promotions and credits are applied as shown at booking and cannot be exchanged for cash. Tips are voluntary and go to the driver. A receipt for every ride is kept in Ride history."},
gatW(){return"Cancellations and no-shows"},
gatV(){return"You can cancel a ride in the app. Cancelling after the free window shown in the app, or not being at the pickup point when the free waiting time runs out, may be charged the fee shown before booking. If a driver cancels, you pay nothing for that ride."},
gatY(){return"Behaviour in the car"},
gatX(){return"Treat drivers and vehicles with respect, wear your seat belt and follow the law. No smoking, no dangerous or illegal items, no more passengers than seats. Damage you cause can be charged to you. We may pause or close an account that abuses drivers, the app or other riders."},
gau_(){return"Safety tools"},
gatZ(){return"The Safety Kit lets you share your trip, check the ride details and reach emergency services. These tools help you, but they are not a replacement for calling the emergency number when you are in danger. Use 112 in Sweden."},
gau1(){return"Ratings and messages"},
gau0(){return"After a ride you can rate the driver and leave a comment. Messages you send to Movera through Help are read by our team and kept with the ride they concern, so we can answer and follow up."},
gatC(){return"Our role and liability"},
gatB(){return"Movera arranges rides with licensed, independent drivers and transport partners who carry out the transport. We are responsible for the app and the booking; the partner is responsible for driving. Nothing in these terms limits rights you have as a consumer under Swedish or EU law. Beyond that, we are not liable for indirect losses, and our liability for a trip is limited to the price of that trip."},
gatE(){return"Ending or deleting your account"},
gatD(){return"You can delete your account at any time in Account \u203a Privacy. Deletion cannot be undone, and you are signed out on this device at once. Receipts and records that bookkeeping law requires us to keep are kept only for as long as that law says. We may close an account that breaks these terms."},
gatG(){return"Changes and governing law"},
gatF(){return"We may update these terms when the service changes; the app shows the date of the current version and asks you to accept material changes. Swedish law applies. Disputes can be brought before the Swedish courts, and as a consumer you can also turn to the National Board for Consumer Disputes (ARN) or the EU online dispute resolution platform."},
gatK(){return"Crash and error reports"},
gatJ(){return"When the app crashes or shows an error, it automatically sends a report to Movera so we can fix it: the error, where in the app it happened, the app version, the platform and the time. Names, phone numbers, e-mail addresses, addresses and locations are removed before the report leaves your device. Reports are kept for 30 days."},
gatI(){return"Contact"},
gatH(){return"Questions about these terms: [support email], or Help in the app."},
gao1(){return"Who is responsible"},
gao0(){return"[Company legal name], organisation number [org. no.], [address], Sweden, is the controller of the personal data processed in the Movera app. Contact: [support email]."},
gao3(){return"What we collect"},
gao2(){return"Your name, mobile number and, if you give it, your e-mail; the places you save; your ride requests, trips, receipts and ratings; your location while you request and take a ride; the payment method you choose (we never see your full card number, our payment provider keeps it); your app language, device type and notification settings; and the messages you send us through Help."},
gao5(){return"Why we use it"},
gao4(){return"To run your rides and reservations, show you prices, match you with a driver and send you receipts (to perform our contract with you). To keep riders and drivers safe, prevent fraud and improve the app (our legitimate interest). To keep accounting records (a legal obligation). To send you news and offers only when you have said yes (your consent, which you can withdraw at any time)."},
gao7(){return"Location"},
gao6(){return"We use your location to set the pickup, to show you nearby cars, to follow the trip and to run the safety tools. Location is used while the app is open and while a ride is active; the app tells you when precise location is off. You can turn location off in your phone settings; some features will then not work."},
gao9(){return"Who we share it with"},
gao8(){return"Your driver sees your first name, pickup, destination and rating. Service providers process data for us under contract: our payment provider, the SMS service that sends your code, Apple and Google when you sign in with them, our map and address provider, and our cloud hosting within the EU/EEA. We share data with authorities only when the law requires it. We never sell your data."},
gaob(){return"How long we keep it"},
gaoa(){return"Account details for as long as your account is active. Trip records and receipts for as long as Swedish bookkeeping law requires, currently seven years. Support messages for as long as needed to handle the case. Location data from a trip only for as long as needed for receipts, safety and dispute handling, then it is deleted or anonymised."},
gaod(){return"Your rights"},
gaoc(){return"You can ask to see the data we hold about you, correct it, have it deleted, receive a copy, object to processing based on our legitimate interest and withdraw a consent. Write to [support email]. You can also complain to the Swedish Authority for Privacy Protection (IMY)."},
gaof(){return"Deleting your account"},
gaoe(){return"Delete your account in Account \u203a Privacy. It cannot be undone, and you are signed out on this device at once. We keep only what the law requires, for as long as it requires."},
gaoh(){return"Children"},
gaog(){return"Movera accounts are for people aged 18 and over. We do not knowingly collect data from children; if you believe a child has created an account, contact us and we will remove it."},
ganW(){return"Security"},
ganV(){return"Data travels encrypted between the app and our servers. Access inside Movera is limited to the people who need it for their work, and your session on this device ends when you sign out or delete your account."},
ganY(){return"Notifications and marketing"},
ganX(){return"We send notifications about your rides and reservations. News and offers are sent only if you have turned them on, and you can change this at any time in Account \u203a Notifications."},
gao_(){return"Changes and contact"},
ganZ(){return"We update this notice when our processing changes and show the date of the current version here. Questions: [support email], or Help in the app."},
